    {
        "text": "The Sarkaz stopped."
    },
    {
        "text": "The burning ruins collapsed in towards the center. Those monstrous creatures looked down on us from above."
    },
    {
        "text": "A woman suddenly emerged from the center of the circle. A very... strange woman."
    },
    {
        "text": "She wasn't Sarkaz. She stood in the center of the battlefield, her expression unchanging."
    },
    {
        "text": "Ines was trembling, but I couldn't tell you why."
    },
    {
        "text": "The explosion must have damaged my hearing. I couldn't hear what they were saying."
    },
    {
        "text": "But I knew they were afraid."
    },
    {
        "text": "Was it because of her?"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, their attention was focused in another direction, on someone else."
    },
    {
        "text": "In the seconds before I lost consciousness, I saw\u2014\u2014"
    },
    {
        "text": "A... Sarkaz."
    },
    {
        "text": "An unthreatening... slender Sarkaz."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_black",
