    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkness02_intro",
        "key": "$darkness02_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.4,
        "xstrength": 0,
        "ystrength": 8,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 30,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where am I...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "On a landship.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Landship...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "How are we still alive?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If you're gonna screw around, can you leave me out of it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Sigh*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "Long story short, we got rescued.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "So where are we?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The main convoy. This is the landship we were protecting. Now it's hauling our wounded.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like it's still under construction. I can't tell how it all fits together. Weird.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "(But the shadow I saw... It was... Some questions are better left unanswered.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What about Hoederer?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "He's with the client... Err, he's... talking to the boss of this place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Right. If you're still hanging around here, Hoederer must be fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Tch.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "So what's the deal with 'the boss of this place?'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "You look nervous. And I don't need to blind myself with Originium Arts to figure that out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't tell me you think I'm hanging out here because I care about you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Definitely not. So what's the reason?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "*Sigh.*",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "I guess I just feel bad for him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who knows what kinds of monsters are in that room with him...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_corridor_2",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
