        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_049",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Try to relax. Nervousness will only drag down our efficiency.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "You did the best you could. The leak was our fault.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_049",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We don't really look for fault on the battlefield. I know who I'm dealing with.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_049",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_049",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But I can't say I expected that commander... to be one of Her Majesty's own.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're... a lot stronger than I expected. I haven't had a chance to thank you yet, Dr. Kal'tsit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_049",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Theresa's the one you should be thanking.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "What was that about me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.4,
        "xstrength": 0,
        "ystrength": 8,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 30,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your Majesty\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_056",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We're not in Kazdel anymore. Let's not stand on ceremony. We're here to sit down and talk, Hoederer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047"
    },
    {
        "text": "By your command.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "And, the one in the coat there must be...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_048"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_056"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hope you don't mind. It's very important that the Doctor be well aware of any new intelligence.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you for understanding.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
