    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "(It really is a landship... But it's pretty big, huh...?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "(There are parts that look new, but some bits are so old they're practically falling apart...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "(I think... this is from Rim Billiton...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_051"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh! S-sorry. They're still building this place...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Small Cautus"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. Kal'tsit said... not to go any deeper. It's dangerous...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Small Cautus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046"
    },
    {
        "text": "Uh huh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay. I'll go somewhere else.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_051"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thanks.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Small Cautus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.7,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.7,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046"
    },
    {
        "text": "What a nice kid. With those ears, she's definitely not Sarkaz.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come to think of it, that one lady who sucks even more than Ines, that doctor, she isn't a Sarkaz either...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's going on here? I look around in the middle of a battle and nobody's Sarkaz?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "How could you be jammed again?!"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.7,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.7,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_056"
    },
    {
        "text": "Happy place, Closure. That's only the seventh short circuit today...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_056",
        "name2": "avg_npc_050",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "THE\u2014\u2014SEVENTH\u2014\u2014SHORT\u2014\u2014CIRCUIT\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kind of embarrassing for a genius engineer, huh? What if we invested in a new set of doors? That'd save some time!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_056",
        "name2": "avg_npc_050",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh... well, we have so many wounded to care for. Their provisions are rather expensive, in both manpower and resources...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "And wouldn't giving up be an even bigger embarrassment...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_056",
        "name2": "avg_npc_050",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Waaaahhhh\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay! Your Majesty!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "text": "Give me three days! If I can't fix it in three days, I'll take the whole security control system apart and reinstall it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_056",
        "name2": "avg_npc_050",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Re-reinstall? You can do that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_056",
        "name2": "avg_npc_050",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I dunno who built these mysterious systems and then buried them out in Rim Billiton somewhere, then if we can't figure it out...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll just have to replace it with something we can! Easy peasy!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_056",
        "name2": "avg_npc_050",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Well... I'll leave you to it then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_056",
        "name2": "avg_npc_050",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Roger that!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_056"
    },
    {
        "text": "...*Sigh*.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island... how long will it be until you're up and running...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_056"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're... I remember, you were with Hoederer...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've regained consciousness? Your wounds were quite serious.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Did I scare her...?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm W, the mercenary. I'm looking for Captain Hoederer and I kinda got lost...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_056"
    },
    {
        "text": "Be careful where you wander. This place is still being built. There are a lot of exposed wires. You could get shocked.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I have a feeling such caution is second nature to you, no?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046",
        "name2": "avg_npc_056",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "W, was it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "You may call me Theresa.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046",
        "name2": "avg_npc_056",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046",
        "name2": "avg_npc_056",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hoederer had words with the Doctor after our meeting. I believe he should be back in his room in Medical by now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't make them worry. You ought to head back too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046",
        "name2": "avg_npc_056",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Theresa... Your Majesty?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046",
        "name2": "avg_npc_056",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh? Well, we're not in Kazdel anymore. No need for titles.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046",
        "name2": "avg_npc_056",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay, Theresa... Majesty, why were you wrestling with a door just now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "And that short girl there is an engineer, right? I mean, it's just a door...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046",
        "name2": "avg_npc_056",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not just a door.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046",
        "name2": "avg_npc_056",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "O... kay?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046",
        "name2": "avg_npc_056",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "How many things are there totally unworthy of my attention?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046",
        "name2": "avg_npc_056",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "So what's Rhodes Island?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046",
        "name2": "avg_npc_056",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, you heard that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "That is the name of this vessel. Although it has not yet been officially christened... that is the name I wish for it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe it's just my whimsy. The Doctor and Kal'tsit may reject its 'true name.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046",
        "name2": "avg_npc_056",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Heh. True name? For this landship?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046",
        "name2": "avg_npc_056",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You saw. This vessel wasn't built in Kazdel.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "Searching deep in the oldest records we have, I came across that name...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Rhodes Island.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not actually sure what it means. Hm... Kal'tsit should know more.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "But that is what I want to name it. It already had a name, after all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046",
        "name2": "avg_npc_056",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Her Majesty Theresa fought against the Regent who usurped Kazdel... She personally brought together more than half the Sarkaz clans...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "(...and she's fixing a door herself?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046",
        "name2": "avg_npc_056",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What's wrong? You have an odd expression on your face.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046",
        "name2": "avg_npc_056",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Would it be considered improper to laugh in front of Your Majesty?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046",
        "name2": "avg_npc_056",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "N-no... But neither Kal'tsit nor the Doctor are the laughing type... and the warriors have too much on their plates for such frivolity.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "I would quite like it if you all would smile.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "But that is perhaps an extravagant hope. I understand the pressure I've placed on everyone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046",
        "name2": "avg_npc_056",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "So I'm cool to laugh then?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046",
        "name2": "avg_npc_056",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Um, yes?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046",
        "name2": "avg_npc_056",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nah, the magic's gone. Can't do it...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046",
        "name2": "avg_npc_056",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Why do I feel like that's my fault?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046",
        "name2": "avg_npc_056",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hehe... well, I wouldn't dare.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046",
        "name2": "avg_npc_056",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What about you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046",
        "name2": "avg_npc_056",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What about me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046",
        "name2": "avg_npc_056",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I am Theresa, this is Rhodes Island, and you are?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046",
        "name2": "avg_npc_056",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "'W'......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046",
        "name2": "avg_npc_056",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's not what I mean. 'W' is a mercenary codename. I want to know your true name. The one that represents you..",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "You need not cloak yourself in a disguise tainted by war. This goes beyond names. Let's just say I'm nosy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046",
        "name2": "avg_npc_056",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046",
        "name2": "avg_npc_056",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh... forgive me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't have a name?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046",
        "name2": "avg_npc_056",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's pretty common for Sarkaz born in Kazdel.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "We don't really care much for... names. People forget them all the time. What's the point in making an effort to remember a name?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046",
        "name2": "avg_npc_056",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't want to forget them. I can't forget them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you wait for the dust to settle in Kazdel... until you're no longer 'W,' we could speak like this once again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe then you could have a more fitting name. A proper name for a Sarkaz woman like yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "Like Rhodes Island. A name makes things feel so much warmer, doesn't it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046",
        "name2": "avg_npc_056",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "I never really thought about it...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_049",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Theresa, message.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kazdel is on the move. The Doctor is getting ready.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_056"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right, I'm on my way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "W?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046",
        "name2": "avg_npc_056",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, yeah, I'm here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046",
        "name2": "avg_npc_056",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "If you are willing to fight for us still, you will always be welcome here. No matter what.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.7,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.7,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_049"
    },
    {
        "text": "...*Sigh*.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not going to criticize Theresa's decision, but...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't expect too warm a welcome. I've seen your record. You're dangerous.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046",
        "name2": "avg_npc_049",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh. Same?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046",
        "name2": "avg_npc_049",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You're recovering fast, but not enough to have you wandering around as you please.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go back to bed before we have to have someone carry you there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$loneliness_intro",
        "key": "$loneliness_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "I realized later."
    },
    {
        "text": "I never dared to look Theresa in the eye."
    },
    {
        "text": "Why?"
    },
    {
        "text": "She looked so naive."
    },
    {
        "text": "It wasn't the look of a leader at the head of one of the armies in our cruel war..."
    },
    {
        "text": "Is naive the word...?"
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't have eyes like that when you're naive... Such... sad eyes."
    },
    {
        "text": "And those two were always at her side, it seemed."
    },
    {
        "text": "If... if I could stand with them..."
    },
    {
        "text": "What kind of sights would I see?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_048"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046"
    },
    {
        "text": "......?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "(That hood... is that the 'Doctor' they were talking about?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Is that person... looking my way...?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "\uff08......\uff09",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "(What the... Why...?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Am I scared? Scared of what? That person gives off pretty normal vibes, but...? No, it's too vague. I've never seen anyone that weird before...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Oh... that's Babel's battlefield commander. I remember now...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "('The Doctor,' huh?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "image"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm starting to get why Ines wouldn't go near Her Majesty."
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe it would be better to look out for myself every once in a while."
    },
    {
        "text": "But... I'm not sure why... Ugh, when it comes to Theresa, I never really knew why..."
    },
    {
        "text": "Call it a whim. Hoederer and the others would understand."
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "image"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    }
]